[{"_1":2,"_3":4},"root",{"_5":170},"routes/guides.$slug",{"_5":6},"data",{"_7":8},"guide",{"_9":10,"_11":12,"_13":14,"_15":16,"_17":18,"_19":20,"_21":22,"_23":24,"_25":26,"_27":28,"_29":30},"title","Boo Basket for Boyfriend: 12 Spooky Gift Ideas He Will Love","slug","boo-basket-for-boyfriend","category","gifts-for-him","seoTitle","Boo Basket for Boyfriend: 12 Halloween Gift Basket Ideas for Him (2026)","metaDescription","How to make a boo basket for your boyfriend: 12 Halloween gift ideas he will love, from horror movie games and spooky socks to snacks and a cozy blanket.","image","https://images.pexels.com/photos/3139093/pexels-photo-3139093.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1216&h=912&fit=crop","imageAlt","A pumpkin bucket with spooky legs and pumpkins","intro","A boo basket is a Halloween gift basket full of spooky little things, and guys love them more than they admit. You do not need to spend a lot. Pick 5 or 6 items below, add his favorite snacks, put it all in a basket with paper filler, and leave it at his door (ring the bell and run, that is the tradition). Our top pick for every basket: funny Halloween socks. Cheap, cute and he will wear them every October.","sections",[79,80,81],"comparison",{"_45":46,"_47":48},"faq",[31,32,33,34],{"_35":43,"_37":44},{"_35":41,"_37":42},{"_35":39,"_37":40},{"_35":36,"_37":38},"question","When should I give a boo basket?","answer","Any day in the week before Halloween. Earlier is better, so he can use the blanket and play the game on Halloween night.","How much should a boo basket cost?","As much as you want. A few small items and candy already make a great basket. It is the idea that counts.","What do you put in a boo basket for your boyfriend?","Funny Halloween socks, his favorite candy, a cozy blanket, a horror movie game, a candle and a small love note. 5 or 6 items is enough.","What is a boo basket?","A Halloween gift basket full of spooky treats and small gifts. The tradition is to leave it at someone's door, ring the bell and run.","columns",[76,77,78],"rows",[49,50,51,52,53],{"_54":72,"_56":73},{"_54":68,"_56":69},{"_54":64,"_56":65},{"_54":60,"_56":61},{"_54":55,"_56":57},"label","Crochet ghost","values",[58,59],"Sweet and personal","Love note","Candy mix",[62,63],"Fills the basket","Treats","Horror trivia cards",[66,67],"Fun to do together","Activity","Halloween blanket",[70,71],"Cozy movie nights","Big item","Halloween socks",[74,75],"Funny, he wears them","Main gift","Item","Why it works","Basket role",{"_82":143,"_84":144,"_86":145},{"_82":116,"_84":117,"_86":118},{"_82":83,"_84":85,"_86":87},"heading","Snacks and drinks","text","No boo basket is complete without treats.","products",[88,89,90,91],{"_92":111,"_19":112,"_95":113,"_97":114,"_99":115},{"_92":106,"_19":107,"_95":108,"_97":109,"_99":110},{"_92":101,"_19":102,"_95":103,"_97":104,"_99":105},{"_92":93,"_19":94,"_95":96,"_97":98,"_99":100},"name","The sweet note: \"You're my boo\" crochet ghost","https://images.pexels.com/photos/9764795/pexels-photo-9764795.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","alt","Small ghost figurines in a pumpkin bowl","description","A tiny handmade ghost with a cute message. The little love note that makes the basket yours. 4.9 stars from over 300 buyers.","amazonUrl","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0FJS6849Q?tag=relations0237-20","For the drinks guy: skull shot glasses","https://images.pexels.com/photos/32176015/pexels-photo-32176015.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Two orange glasses on a white table","Two crystal skull glasses for his favorite drink. Spooky, and still nice all year. Over 300 reviews.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DQCCTQK?tag=relations0237-20","Movie night upgrade: popcorn seasoning set","https://images.pexels.com/photos/8652476/pexels-photo-8652476.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Popcorn and old film reels on a dark table","Six popcorn flavors so your horror movie night feels like a real cinema. Over 24,000 reviews.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00H727M6O?tag=relations0237-20","Must-have: chocolate candy mix","https://images.pexels.com/photos/14147299/pexels-photo-14147299.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","A pile of Halloween candy","M&M'S, Twix and Snickers in one big bag. Fill the gaps in the basket with these. Over 4,500 reviews.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BK1Z6V43?tag=relations0237-20","For the horror movie lover","If his favorite season is \"scary movie season\", these are for him.",[119,120,121,122],{"_92":138,"_19":139,"_95":140,"_97":141,"_99":142},{"_92":133,"_19":134,"_95":135,"_97":136,"_99":137},{"_92":128,"_19":129,"_95":130,"_97":131,"_99":132},{"_92":123,"_19":124,"_95":125,"_97":126,"_99":127},"Morning scare: horror coffee mug","https://images.pexels.com/photos/30588671/pexels-photo-30588671.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","A woman holding a horror mask","A horror-themed mug for his morning coffee. A small gift he uses every day. Over 1,100 reviews.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PCT3Z5F?tag=relations0237-20","Collector pick: Ghostface Funko Pop","https://images.pexels.com/photos/11003194/pexels-photo-11003194.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","A dark figure in a hood","A little Ghostface figure for his desk or shelf. Small, cheap and very on theme. Over 2,300 reviews.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0CND1KMSD?tag=relations0237-20","Movie night plan: top 50 horror movies scratch-off","https://images.pexels.com/photos/28821625/pexels-photo-28821625.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","A neon cinema sign at night","A scratch-off poster of the 50 best horror movies. Watch one, scratch one. A plan for every Friday night. Over 700 reviews.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0CR6T68WL?tag=relations0237-20","Best game: horror movie trivia cards","https://images.pexels.com/photos/28859500/pexels-photo-28859500.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","A person in zombie makeup","Hundreds of horror movie questions. Play it together on Halloween night and see who really knows the classics. Over 2,000 reviews.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JVF73RY?tag=relations0237-20","The base of every boo basket","Start with these. They make the basket look full and feel cozy.",[146,147,148,149],{"_92":165,"_19":166,"_95":167,"_97":168,"_99":169},{"_92":160,"_19":161,"_95":162,"_97":163,"_99":164},{"_92":155,"_19":156,"_95":157,"_97":158,"_99":159},{"_92":150,"_19":151,"_95":152,"_97":153,"_99":154},"Make it look full: crinkle paper filler","https://images.pexels.com/photos/5859364/pexels-photo-5859364.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Hands holding an orange Halloween bucket","Shredded paper filler that makes any basket look professional in 2 minutes. Over 3,300 reviews.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0CMCQGY9K?tag=relations0237-20","For the smell of fall: spiced pumpkin candle","https://images.pexels.com/photos/11137699/pexels-photo-11137699.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Candles on a wooden tray","A big Yankee Candle that makes his place smell like October. Over 1,700 reviews.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0F3DRTCB2?tag=relations0237-20","Coziest add: Halloween throw blanket","https://images.pexels.com/photos/6633533/pexels-photo-6633533.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","A soft blanket on a couch","A soft spooky blanket for horror movie nights, so he thinks of you every time he uses it. Over 6,900 reviews.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0H8TTGKS9?tag=relations0237-20","Top pick: funny Halloween socks","https://images.pexels.com/photos/10563910/pexels-photo-10563910.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","People wearing colorful striped socks","A pack of spooky novelty socks with pumpkins, ghosts and skulls. Small, funny and he will actually wear them. Over 4,000 reviews.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0CG13NRZ9?tag=relations0237-20",{"_171":172},"origin","https://relationshipgoals.store"]
